@startuml resilience-flow
title Resiliência - lançamento independe do consolidado (RNF1)

skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

actor Cliente as C
rectangle "transaction-service" as TX
database "Outbox" as OB
rectangle "Dispatcher" as D
queue "RabbitMQ" as Q
rectangle "consolidation-service\n(pode estar fora)" as CO #FDECEA

C --> TX
TX --> OB
OB --> D
D --> Q
Q --> CO

note bottom of TX
  POST /transactions confirma no commit do outbox.
  Não toca RabbitMQ nem consolidado -> 201 mesmo com consolidado fora.
end note

@enduml
